<title>BELGIUM: EU raises most distant grain import duties.</title>
<headline>EU raises most distant grain import duties.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union will on Tuesday (April 1) raise duties on transatlantic imports of high quality soft wheat to 23.06 ecus a tonne, from 20.73 ecus, the U.K. Intervention Board said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Duties on other cereal varieties were also increased, but there was a cut on low quality wheat.</p>
